    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exceptional opportunity to acquire a completely refurbished four-bedroom semi-detached home in the highly sought-after College Park in Newbridge.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this impressive property has been thoughtfully refurbished with a contemporary aesthetic, featuring clean lines, quality finishes and a bright, modern feel throughout. The generous accommodation is ideally suited to family living. Upon entering, a welcoming entrance hallway leads to the principal living accommodation. The ground floor comprises a modern kitchen, separate utility room, dining room, spacious living room, family room and a convenient guest WC. Upstairs, there are four bedrooms, including a generous master bedroom with ensuite, together with a well-appointed family bathroom. The bedrooms are bright and versatile, providing ample space for a growing family.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from a large rear garden, offering excellent potential for outdoor entertaining, children's play areas and family enjoyment.\n\nThis beautifully refurbished home combines generous proportions with a fresh, contemporary finish and an excellent family-friendly layout. Its location in College Park provides convenient access to local schools, amenities, transport links and the wider town.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, under stairs storage\n\nKitchen/Dining: Tiled flooring, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, worktop, oven, hob, extractor fan, access to utility room and dining room, back door leading to rear garden\n\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring, worktop\n\nDining Room: Wooden flooring, sliding patio door with access to rear garden\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, feature fireplace\n\nFamily Room: Carpet flooring \n\nMaster Bedroom: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nEnsuite: Tiled floor to ceiling, shower, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 4: Carpet flooring\n\nFeatures:\n\nHardwood front door\nPVC double glazed windows\nSelected carpets, blinds and light fittings included\nOutside light\nSide gate access to rear\nConcrete driveway\nMains water\nMains sewage\nOil fired central heating\nBuilt in 1966\nc.126.42sqmt \n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
